    "animation_variable_placeholders": "direct =1\nqd_thita =0.96\nwheel = direct *-time *360/1\nd_thita=math.sin(-time *360/5)/2+0.5\ndx = math.pow(d_thita,2)*0.13*0.13*math.cos(wheel+90)*math.cos(wheel+90)\ndz=math.sqrt(1.045*1.045-0.4*0.4*math.cos(wheel)*math.cos(wheel))-1.045\n\nqubing_x=(0.4*math.sin(wheel)-3.045+math.sqrt(3.045*3.045-0.4*0.4*math.cos(wheel)*math.cos(wheel)))*16\n\nqifa_x=direct *-math.sin(wheel+90)*16*(0.016+math.abs(0.12*d_thita))+dx*10\nangel_hebinggan=-math.atan((qubing_x/16)/(0.94))-1+math.sin(wheel+90)*8*direct*d_thita\nqifa_x2 =direct*-math.sin(wheel+90)*16*(0.016+math.abs(0.12*d_thita))+dz\nqimenggoubei_z=qifa_x2-math.sin(wheel)*0.8+dz*1+1\nbanjingan_angel=direct*d_thita*12+math.sin(wheel+80)*1*d_thita\npi = 3.1415926535\nwheel2=wheel-90\nl1 = 0.225 *16\nl2 = 27.399968\nl3 = 0.607*16 \nl4 = 1.9804 *16\nlbd_2 = ((l1*l1) + (l4*l4) - (2 * l1*l4 *math.cos(wheel2-90)))\nlbd = math.sqrt(lbd_2)\nphi1 = math.asin( l1/lbd * math.sin(wheel2))\nphi2 = math.acos((lbd_2  + l3*l3 - l2*l2 ) / (2*lbd*l3))\nthita3 = (phi1+phi2)\nthita2 = math.asin(((l3*math.sin(-thita3-11.4502))+(l1*math.sin(wheel2+90-20)))/l2)\nyueyanban_angel=(thita3*0.76 -20)*1\nt1=math.sin(wheel)*15-103",
